# bot.reserved — reserved channels/nicks (leak_guard.py).
#
# Anything said in a reserved channel is *context*, never to be paraphrased
# back onto the open network. One glob per line (fnmatch, matched lowercase).
# An empty file (comments only, as here) disables the gate: nothing reserved.
#
# Comment syntax: a bare '#' or '#' + space. A channel like '#brain-private'
# (no space) is a rule, not a comment.
#
# Example rule:
# #brain-private
